      "message": "Addressed in PS2. Each frame segment must now return exactly its requested size. A short result with no error_code becomes io_error, prevents the payload segment from being sent, avoids TX accounting, and shuts down the mux. testChannelRequestShortWrite covers the two-segment path.",
