      "writtenOn": "2026-07-14T01:20:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IceTransport::send() currently assigns errno on every path that returns -1: EINVAL when no remote address or an invalid byte count is observed, EIO for send failures, and EAGAIN for PJ_EBUSY. IceSocketEndpoint reads it immediately on the same thread, so there is no uncovered stale-errno return path here.",
      "parentUuid": "d6f66988_7d4a4bac",
      "revId": "8bc3ab1564b66761ca794df3c6aacd067d5c97b4",
