      "message": "The fixture waits until canSendBeacon() is true on both muxes before installing the callback. This proves both Version writes were completed and processed, and this scenario schedules no beacon. Keeping the exact count therefore verifies that a short header write does not proceed to the payload segment; the public callback count is checked separately for exactly-once semantics.",
